# Your own Stack Exchange key. Get a free one at
# https://stackapps.com/apps/oauth/register
#
# Without a key, Stack Overflow allows 300 requests a day per IP address,
# shared by everyone on the same network. With a key it's 10,000 a day.
#
# Best: save this as vimquire.env in your Neovim config folder
# (run :echo stdpath("config") to find it). That survives plugin updates
# and reinstalls.
# Also works: save it as .env in this folder. It's git-ignored, but
# reinstalling the plugin deletes it.
STACKEXCHANGE_KEY=
